# faithfulness_cases.jsonl — LLM synthesis faithfulness eval cases.
# Extends cases.jsonl with term expectations + gate expectations for the synthesis tier.
# One JSON object per line. Run: python3 -m wikikb faithfulness
#
# Fields:
#   query        — the question (mirrors cases.jsonl)
#   domain       — keycloak | active-directory | cisco-ios-xe
#   kind         — easy | lexical-miss (from cases.jsonl)
#   expect_any_of — expected reference note IDs (mirrors cases.jsonl)
#   expect_terms — terms the LLM's answer SHOULD mention (from the expected notes)
#   reject_terms — terms that would signal contamination (unrelated domains)
#   expect_gate  — expected Confidence gate result: "none" | "out-of-coverage"
#   question_tier — tier for the gate: conceptual | support-kb | scenarios
#   pair/variant — optional, mirrors cases.jsonl for paired exact/paraphrase tracking

